<title>USA: NOTICE OF SALE - Folsom Cordova USD, Calif.</title>
<headline>NOTICE OF SALE - Folsom Cordova USD, Calif.</headline>
<text>
<p>NOTICE OF INTENTION TO SELL</p>
<p>			 Not To Exceed $10,000,000</p>
<p>			  Folsom Cordova Unified</p>
<p>				School District</p>
<p>		    (Sacramento County, California)</p>
<p>			  1996-97 Tax and Revenue</p>
<p>			    Anticipation Notes</p>
<p>Bids for the  above-described notes,  will be  received on the official bid form until 9:35 a.m. California time, on</p>
<p>			 Wednesday, October 9, 1996,</p>
<p> at  the  offices  of   the  District's  financial   advisor,</p>
<p>Government Financial  Strategies, Inc.,  1228</p>
<p>									     St</p>
<p>Suite Thirteen, Sacramento, California 95814-5609, Telephone (916) 444-5100, Telecopier (916)  444-5109. Faxed bids  will be accepted. The official bid form, official notice of  sale and official statement may  be obtained from the  District's Financial Advisor.</p>
<p>			  (From The Bond Buyer)</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
